{"1531066761960988674":{"a":"<p>RT @ARISS_status: ARISS ct. w/Old St. Mary&#x27;s School, Chicago, Illinois. The ct. is on May 31 at 16:32 UTC. Ct. is multipoint telebridge w/…</p>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1531066761960988674\">https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1531066761960988674</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1531066761960988674</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1531066761960988674\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2022-05-30T00:15:36Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>retweet</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1531091530546561028":{"a":"<p>I was rambling about this recently as I recall. RADAR really isn&#x27;t used to locate aircraft these days. The transponder does all the work. radar console is a nice display but the radar data itself is only used to see untracked aircraft and debris like birds or tornados. <a href=\"https://x.com/DJSnM/status/1531057989875945472\">Tweet by @DJSnM</a></p>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/DJSnM/status/1531057989875945472\">https://x.com/DJSnM/status/1531057989875945472</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1531091530546561028</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1531091530546561028\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2022-05-30T01:54:01Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>original</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1531092299362492416":{"a":"<p>Neat! <a href=\"https://x.com/JohnMPowell1/status/1531090535082905600\">Tweet by @JohnMPowell1</a></p>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/JohnMPowell1/status/1531090535082905600\">https://x.com/JohnMPowell1/status/1531090535082905600</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1531092299362492416</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1531092299362